      "message": "Yes, LOOSE is very valuable, and in fact the default. A LOT of crates are at version 0.x, and upgrading to 0.y is very often OK, even though the strict rules of semver compatibility say otherwise.\n\nWhat I have found in practice is:\n* 0.x and 0.y are probably compatible,\n* 1.x and 1.y are probably compatible,\n* 1.x and 2.y are probably incompatible\n* But all 3 statements are far from certain.",
